<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo sets 500 mln mark two-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo sets 500 mln mark two-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    04.AUG.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +5 BP     PAY DATE    04.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 ISS PRICE  100.035   FULL FEES   0.075</p>
<p> LISTING    FRANKFURT DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.025     SELL CONC  0.05	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
